{
  "slug": "ccbeep",
  "name": "Ccbeep",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Sound notifications for Claude Code. Plays distinct system sounds when tasks complete or fail, so you don't need to watch the terminal. Zero dependencies — uses only built-in OS tools (afplay on macOS, paplay on Linux, PowerShell on Windows).\nFeatures one-command install, interactive sound picker, timed mute, and per-event sound customization via config file.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 hooks**, `PermissionRequest`, `Stop`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ccbeep@claude-community` from `TheGreatCBH/CCBeep`.\n\nEnglish &nbsp;|&nbsp; 中文说明\n\nSound notifications for Claude Code. Plays distinct system sounds when tasks complete or fail, so you don't need to watch the terminal. Zero dependencies — uses only built-in OS tools (afplay on macOS, paplay on Linux, PowerShell on Windows).\nFeatures one-command install, interactive sound picker, timed mute, and per-event sound customization via config file.",
